\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tUses mana drain but only against druids. This mechanic was confirmed to be intended in a CM post by Skerio on 23.01.2020.<br/><br/>A freakish lost soul attacks in melee range. A freakish lost soul never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Its experience was decreased from 7800 to 7020 while its loot rate was increased by 24% with Update 12.31.</li>\n<li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2,295 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-5</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><spa